FoloOS AI Passport

This repository contains an unofficial community-derived firmware and host
tooling for FoloToy AI Passport. It is not an official FoloToy release and is
not endorsed or supported by FoloToy.

Official upstream projects and documentation:
- https://github.com/FoloToy/ai-passport
- https://github.com/FoloToy/folo-ai-passport-xiaozhi
- https://docs.folotoy.com/zh/docs/web-tool/

The existing MIT License and upstream copyright notice are preserved. Third-
party assets and dependencies remain subject to their own licenses.
